{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"8971fae9ebd28d6096c97a7d89cfc63629f050b0c9103399be25d76128fdf44a","ja":"それじゃ、『クラブミリオン』でまた、\n私達のライブができたことを祝して……乾杯！","zh":"那么，就为我们能再次在“Club Million”举办演唱会……干杯！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"97bcf64c2873a130a2cb1c4e6284c448cdd70327b686c4531574181fc9b8f1b9","ja":"かんぱーい！　とっても素敵な\nライブだったわね、このみ姉さん♪","zh":"干杯！刚才的演唱会真是精彩绝伦呢，木实姐♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"4193092dcd6fa2940410dc6a67da155ea118a52bdfe3a9e220e86725a6fb9288","ja":"とびきりセクシーに決まったもの！　それに\n打ち上げもこのお店でできるなんて、とっても贅沢ね♪","zh":"格外性感的完美造型！而且连庆功宴都能在这家店举办，真是太奢侈了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
